> f(x: u4) = x*x
> g(x: u4) = (x*x) + (x == 1 ? 1 : 0)
> equiv f g
f and g differ at 1 point, e.g. x=1: 1 vs 2
> equiv g f
g and f differ at 1 point, e.g. x=1: 2 vs 1
> range f
range of f -> u4:
  0..9   (4 distinct values)
  values: 0..1, 4, 9
  fits in u4
  over all 16 points of the domain
> range g
range of g -> u4:
  0..9   (5 distinct values)
  values: 0..2, 4, 9
  fits in u4
  over all 16 points of the domain
